# Code Style

## Always use braces for control flow

Use braces for every `if`, `else`, `for`, `while`, and `do` block, even when the body is a single statement. Always keep the closing brace in its own line.

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD
if (condition) {
  doSomething()
}

for (const item of items) {
  process(item)
}

while (running) {
  tick()
}

// ❌ BAD
if (condition)
  doSomething()

for (const item of items)
  process(item)
```
